==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|en|swep}}
Derived from {{suffix|en|hypnotic|alt1=hypn(otic)|osis|t2=state”, “condition|pos2=nominal derivational suffix}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|hypnoses}}

# a [[trance]]like state, [[artificial]]ly [[induce]]d, in which a person has a [[heighten]]ed [[suggestible|suggestibility]], and in which [[suppress]]ed [[memory|memories]] may be [[experience]]d
# the art or skill of [[hypnotism]]

